{
  "info": {
    "name": "Permission-categories matrix (coarse categories + delegation, Phase 6.5)",
    "description": "The live proof of ADR 0007 through the gateway: deny-overrides (E1), the TAG/WRITE boundary in both directions via delta-dispatch (E2), senior delegation with the LIVE data.role.assignable verdict (E3), the admin tier incl. the designed denial cell (E4), the stale flat role's empty-expansion floor (E5), and ladder parity (E6). The ladder subject is REBOUND between cell groups via the internal bootstrap API (one role per user per team). Run via run-permission-categories-matrix.sh.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
